---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Scene from '../components/Scene.astro';

const pageTitle = 'KnowWeft 知织｜把知识编成可以播放的表达';
const pageDescription = 'KnowWeft 把知识树、场景与时间线放进同一工作台，制作可编辑的视频与课件，并支持原生 PPTX 导入导出。';
---

<SiteLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription} theme="knowweft">
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="knowweft-title">
    <div class="weave-lines" aria-hidden="true">
      <i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b><b></b>
    </div>
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <img class="brand-lockup" src="/brand/knowweft-dark.svg" width="120" height="85" alt="KnowWeft 知织" />
        <p class="eyebrow">知识视频与课件工作台</p>
        <h1 id="knowweft-title">让知识拥有<br /><em>清晰的结构，</em><br />也拥有时间。</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">从知识树开始组织想法，把文字、媒体、镜头与字幕编进场景，最终导出视频或原生可编辑的 PPTX。</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/cyamz/KnowWeft/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">下载最新版本 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#weave-demo">看看知识如何成片 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <p class="platform-note">Windows 安装版与便携版 · Linux AppImage 与 deb</p>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-stage" aria-label="知识线条交织成形的三维视觉">
        <Scene variant="knowweft" />
        <div class="stage-note"><span>KNOWLEDGE</span><span>SCENE</span><span>TIME</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="container manifesto-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">一条完整的创作路径</p>
      <div>
        <h2>想法不再散落在大纲、幻灯片和剪辑软件之间。</h2>
        <p>KnowWeft 用同一个工程承接结构、画面和节奏。每次调整都仍然是内容本身，而不是一张失去编辑能力的截图。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="weave-demo" class="demo-section" aria-labelledby="demo-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading demo-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">浏览器交互演示</p>
          <h2 id="demo-title">从节点到画面，只隔着一次编排。</h2>
        </div>
        <p>选择知识节点，或拖动时间线，观察内容在创作路径中的位置。此处为宣传页演示，实际编辑在桌面应用中完成。</p>
      </div>

      <div class="workbench" data-knowledge-demo style="--demo-accent:#185FA5;--progress:18%">
        <aside class="knowledge-tree" aria-label="示例知识树">
          <div class="panel-title"><span>知识结构</span><small>3 个节点</small></div>
          <p class="tree-root"><span></span>光如何塑造画面</p>
          <div class="tree-branch">
            <button class="tree-node is-active" type="button" data-scene="structure" aria-pressed="true">
              <span class="node-dot blue"></span><span><b>光的方向</b><small>概念与关系</small></span>
            </button>
            <button class="tree-node" type="button" data-scene="visual" aria-pressed="false">
              <span class="node-dot teal"></span><span><b>情绪的温度</b><small>画面与案例</small></span>
            </button>
            <button class="tree-node" type="button" data-scene="motion" aria-pressed="false">
              <span class="node-dot terracotta"></span><span><b>镜头的节奏</b><small>动画与练习</small></span>
            </button>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <div class="scene-editor">
          <div class="editor-bar">
            <span>场景 03 / 光的方向</span>
            <span class="editor-status"><i></i><span data-scene-label>结构正在成形</span></span>
          </div>
          <div class="scene-canvas">
            <div class="light-beam" aria-hidden="true"></div>
            <div class="scene-copy">
              <span data-scene-kicker>知识树</span>
              <h3 data-scene-title>先把复杂主题拆成可理解的路径</h3>
              <p data-scene-body>围绕「光如何塑造画面」展开概念、案例和练习，章节关系一眼可见。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="scene-orbit" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
          </div>
          <div class="timeline-panel">
            <div class="timeline-meta"><span>00:00</span><strong data-time>9 秒</strong><span>00:48</span></div>
            <div class="tracks" aria-hidden="true">
              <span class="track-label">画面</span><i class="clip c1"></i><i class="clip c2"></i><i class="clip c3"></i>
              <span class="track-label">字幕</span><i class="clip caption"></i>
              <span class="track-label">镜头</span><i class="clip camera"></i>
              <b class="playhead" data-playhead></b>
            </div>
            <label class="range-label">
              <span class="sr-only">拖动示例时间线</span>
              <input data-timeline type="range" min="0" max="100" value="18" />
            </label>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="native-section" aria-labelledby="native-title">
    <div class="container native-grid">
      <figure class="product-frame">
        <div class="frame-top"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span>KnowWeft · 教学场景</span></div>
        <img src="/images/knowweft-demo.png" width="1280" height="720" loading="lazy" alt="KnowWeft 示例视频画面，展示教学内容的版式与时间线效果" />
        <figcaption>KnowWeft 示例工程的实际画面</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="native-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">可继续编辑的结果</p>
        <h2 id="native-title">导出的课件，仍然是课件。</h2>
        <p>原生 PPTX 导出保留形状、文本与动画，而不是把每页压成图片。已有 PPTX 也能提取大纲，重新进入知识树。</p>
        <div class="format-flow" aria-label="PPTX 与 KnowWeft 的双向流程">
          <span>PPTX 大纲</span><i aria-hidden="true">⇄</i><span>知识树</span><i aria-hidden="true">→</i><span>视频 / PPTX</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="capabilities" aria-labelledby="capabilities-title">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="capabilities-head">
        <p class="eyebrow">同一块创作画布</p>
        <h2 id="capabilities-title">结构、镜头与交付物，保持同一条逻辑。</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="capability-list">
        <article><span>组织</span><h3>知识树与场景编排</h3><p>把主题拆成节点，再把节点组织成可以讲述的场景路径。</p></article>
        <article><span>表达</span><h3>文本、媒体与镜头</h3><p>在同一个工作台调整画面、字幕、动画、镜头和媒体素材。</p></article>
        <article><span>节奏</span><h3>时间线与可撤销编辑</h3><p>让内容随时间进入，并保留对创作过程的控制。</p></article>
        <article><span>扩展</span><h3>按需配置 AI 服务</h3><p>可选用辅助剪辑、图片生成和朗读能力；服务与密钥由使用者选择。</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="download-section" aria-labelledby="download-title">
    <div class="download-mark" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/brand/knowweft.svg" alt="" /></div>
    <div class="container download-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">开始编织</p>
      <h2 id="download-title">下一段知识，<br />从一个节点开始。</h2>
      <p>普通用户可直接下载 Windows 或 Linux 发布包，无需源码环境。</p>
      <div class="download-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/cyamz/KnowWeft/releases/latest" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">前往 Releases <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/cyamz/KnowWeft/issues" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">反馈问题</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="faq-section" aria-labelledby="faq-title">
    <div class="container faq-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">常见问题</p><h2 id="faq-title">开始之前</h2></div>
      <div class="faq-list">
        <details><summary>一定要配置 AI 服务吗？<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>不需要。知识树、编辑、时间线与原创示例渲染都可以在不配置 AI 服务的情况下使用。</p></details>
        <details><summary>导出的 PPTX 还能修改吗？<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>可以。KnowWeft 导出原生形状、文本与动画，而不是把页面做成截图。</p></details>
        <details><summary>项目文件保存在哪里？<span aria-hidden="true">＋</span></summary><p>桌面应用支持本地工程保存。可选 AI 服务的端点、模型与密钥由使用者自行配置。</p></details>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    import { setupKnowledgeDemo } from '../scripts/knowweft';
    setupKnowledgeDemo();
  </script>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  :global(body[data-theme='knowweft']) { background: #f5f2e9; color: #1c2b3a; }
  .hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; min-height: 830px; color: #f5f2e9; background: #101e2c; }
  .hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background: radial-gradient(circle at 76% 38%, rgba(42,167,155,.17), transparent 30%), linear-gradient(105deg, rgba(24,95,165,.14), transparent 48%); pointer-events: none; }
  .hero-grid { position: relative; z-index: 2; min-height: 830px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0,.92fr) minmax(420px,1.08fr); gap: 2rem; align-items: center; padding-top: 8rem; padding-bottom: 5rem; }
  .hero-copy { max-width: 690px; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .brand-lockup { width: 120px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 2.4rem; }
  .hero .eyebrow { color: #73cfc4; }
  .hero h1 { margin: .9rem 0 1.8rem; font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 6.3vw, 7.6rem); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -.045em; font-weight: 650; }
  .hero h1 em { color: #73cfc4; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; }
  .hero-lead { max-width: 650px; color: #bac6cd; font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.28rem); line-height: 1.8; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1.75rem; margin-top: 2.4rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .hero :global(.button.primary), .download-section :global(.button.primary) { background: #d85a30; color: white; border-color: #d85a30; }
  .text-link { color: #f5f2e9; text-decoration: none; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(245,242,233,.36); padding-bottom: .25rem; }
  .platform-note { margin-top: 1.1rem; color: #8496a1; font-size: .78rem; }
  .hero-stage { position: relative; height: 650px; width: min(720px, 54vw); justify-self: end; }
  .hero-stage :global(.scene) { height: 100%; min-height: 0; }
  .stage-note { position: absolute; inset: auto 6% 8% 12%; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: rgba(245,242,233,.42); font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .24em; }
  .weave-lines { position: absolute; inset: 0; opacity: .28; pointer-events: none; }
  .weave-lines i, .weave-lines b { position: absolute; display: block; border-radius: 999px; }
  .weave-lines i { width: 1px; height: 46vh; top: -8vh; background: linear-gradient(#2aa79b, transparent); transform: rotate(29deg); }
  .weave-lines i:nth-child(1) { right: 18%; }.weave-lines i:nth-child(2) { right: 31%; height: 62vh; }.weave-lines i:nth-child(3) { right: 44%; }
  .weave-lines b { height: 1px; width: 42vw; right: -8vw; top: 28%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, #185fa5); transform: rotate(-8deg); }
  .weave-lines b:last-child { top: 42%; right: 3vw; }
  .manifesto { padding: 8rem 0; background: #f5f2e9; }
  .manifesto-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .55fr 1.45fr; gap: 5rem; }
  .manifesto h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 940px; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 5.7rem); line-height: 1.08; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 580; }
  .manifesto div > p { max-width: 690px; margin: 2.2rem 0 0 auto; color: #66747d; font-size: 1.12rem; line-height: 1.8; }
  .demo-section { padding: 8rem 0; color: #edf4f5; background: #132332; }
  .demo-heading { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.35fr .65fr; gap: 4rem; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
  .demo-heading .eyebrow { color: #73cfc4; }
  .demo-heading h2, .capabilities h2 { margin: .75rem 0 0; font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.4vw, 5rem); line-height: 1.05; letter-spacing: -.05em; font-weight: 580; }
  .demo-heading > p { color: #96a8b2; line-height: 1.75; }
  .workbench { --progress: 18%; overflow: hidden; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 290px 1fr; min-height: 650px; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); background: #0d1924; box-shadow: 0 40px 100px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .knowledge-tree { padding: 1.4rem 1rem; border-right: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); }
  .panel-title, .editor-bar, .timeline-meta { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  .panel-title { color: #c2cdd3; font-size: .78rem; letter-spacing: .05em; padding: .2rem .6rem 1.5rem; }
  .panel-title small { color: #647581; }
  .tree-root { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .65rem; font-size: .84rem; color: #dfe8ec; padding: .8rem .6rem; }
  .tree-root > span { width: 9px; height: 9px; border: 2px solid #73cfc4; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(115,207,196,.1); }
  .tree-branch { position: relative; padding-left: 1.1rem; }
  .tree-branch::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 10px; top: 0; bottom: 1.5rem; width: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.12); }
  .tree-node { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 100%; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; margin: .35rem 0; padding: .82rem .7rem; border: 1px solid transparent; color: #9aacb5; background: transparent; text-align: left; cursor: pointer; transition: background .25s, border-color .25s, color .25s; }
  .tree-node:hover, .tree-node:focus-visible { background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); color: #fff; }
  .tree-node.is-active { color: #fff; border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-accent) 70%, transparent); background: rgba(255,255,255,.055); }
  .tree-node b, .tree-node small { display: block; }.tree-node b { font-size: .84rem; }.tree-node small { margin-top: .2rem; color: #647581; font-size: .68rem; }
  .node-dot { flex: 0 0 auto; width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }.node-dot.blue{background:#4b98d8}.node-dot.teal{background:#40bcae}.node-dot.terracotta{background:#df724e}
  .scene-editor { min-width: 0; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; }
  .editor-bar { padding: .9rem 1.25rem; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); color: #8798a2; font-size: .72rem; }
  .editor-status { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: .45rem; }.editor-status i { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--demo-accent); box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--demo-accent); }
  .scene-canvas { position: relative; min-height: 395px; overflow: hidden; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 3rem; background: radial-gradient(circle at 74% 38%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--demo-accent) 22%, transparent), transparent 31%), linear-gradient(145deg,#172a39,#101d29); }
  .scene-canvas::before { content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(255,255,255,.025) 1px,transparent 1px); background-size: 32px 32px; mask-image: linear-gradient(to bottom,black,transparent); }
  .scene-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; max-width: 590px; text-align: center; }
  .scene-copy > span { color: var(--demo-accent); font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .18em; }
  .scene-copy h3 { margin: .8rem 0 1rem; font-size: clamp(1.9rem,3vw,3.5rem); line-height: 1.1; letter-spacing: -.04em; }
  .scene-copy p { margin: auto; max-width: 540px; color: #9fb0b9; line-height: 1.7; }
  .light-beam { position: absolute; top: -40%; left: 20%; width: 25%; height: 160%; background: linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,color-mix(in srgb,var(--demo-accent) 15%,transparent),transparent); transform: rotate(18deg); }
  .scene-orbit i { position: absolute; border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--demo-accent) 34%,transparent); border-radius: 50%; }.scene-orbit i:nth-child(1){width:330px;height:330px;left:-160px;top:10%}.scene-orbit i:nth-child(2){width:160px;height:160px;right:-55px;bottom:-40px}.scene-orbit i:nth-child(3){width:8px;height:8px;right:18%;top:22%;background:var(--demo-accent);box-shadow:0 0 18px var(--demo-accent)}
  .timeline-panel { padding: .8rem 1.2rem 1rem; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.09); }
  .timeline-meta { color: #647581; font-size: .65rem; }.timeline-meta strong { color: #acbac2; font-weight: 500; }
  .tracks { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 45px 1fr 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 5px; align-items: center; margin: .65rem 0 .4rem; }
  .track-label { grid-column: 1; color: #61727c; font-size: .59rem; }.clip { height: 10px; border-radius: 2px; background: rgba(24,95,165,.55); }.c1{grid-column:2}.c2{grid-column:3;background:rgba(31,145,134,.5)}.c3{grid-column:4;background:rgba(216,90,48,.48)}.caption{grid-column:2/4;background:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}.camera{grid-column:3/5;background:linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(31,145,134,.32),rgba(31,145,134,.1))}
  .playhead { position: absolute; left: var(--progress); top: -2px; bottom: -2px; width: 1px; background: #ee7651; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(238,118,81,.6); pointer-events:none; }
  .playhead::before { content:''; position:absolute; width:7px;height:7px;left:-3px;top:-4px;background:#ee7651;transform:rotate(45deg); }
  .range-label { display: block; }.range-label input { width: calc(100% - 45px); margin-left: 45px; height: 16px; opacity: .001; cursor: ew-resize; }
  .range-label input:focus-visible { opacity: 1; accent-color: #d85a30; }
  .native-section { padding: 9rem 0; background: #ece8dc; }
  .native-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.2fr .8fr; gap: clamp(3rem,7vw,8rem); align-items: center; }
  .product-frame { overflow: hidden; margin: 0; border: 1px solid #d3cec0; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 38px 90px rgba(28,43,58,.14); transform: rotate(-1.4deg); }
  .product-frame img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .frame-top { display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;padding:.72rem .9rem;background:#1c2b3a;color:#8799a4;font-size:.63rem}.frame-top i{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:#d85a30}.frame-top i:nth-child(2){background:#d5aa43}.frame-top i:nth-child(3){background:#1f9186}.frame-top span{margin-left:.5rem}
  .product-frame figcaption { padding: .6rem .8rem; color: #7b858a; font-size: .65rem; }
  .native-copy .eyebrow { color: #185fa5; }.native-copy h2 { margin: .8rem 0 1.7rem; font-size: clamp(2.7rem,4.4vw,5.3rem); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.055em; font-weight: 600; }.native-copy > p { color: #67757d; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.75; }
  .format-flow { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 2.4rem; }.format-flow span { padding: .7rem .9rem; border: 1px solid #c5c0b4; color: #374752; font-size: .75rem; }.format-flow i { color:#1f9186;font-style:normal; }
  .capabilities { padding: 9rem 0; background: #f5f2e9; }.capabilities-head { display:grid;grid-template-columns:.4fr 1.6fr;gap:3rem;margin-bottom:5rem}.capabilities-head .eyebrow{padding-top:.5rem}.capability-list { border-top: 1px solid #cfc9bb; }.capability-list article { display:grid;grid-template-columns:.35fr .8fr 1fr;gap:3rem;align-items:start;padding:2.1rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #cfc9bb}.capability-list span { color:#1f9186;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.14em}.capability-list h3{margin:0;font-size:1.35rem}.capability-list p{margin:0;color:#68757c;line-height:1.7}
